     "receiptDescription": "PRNA PUPPY CHOW",
     "romanceDescription": "<p>Make sure your growing puppy gets the nutrition he needs for his first year of life with this Purina Puppy Chow Tender &amp; Crunchy dry puppy food at the center of his menu.</p><ul><li>Puppy dry dog food packed with high-quality protein, like real beef, for growing muscles</li><li>Bagged puppy food formulated with the building blocks of nutrition to meet the unique needs of growing puppies including DHA to support his vision and brain development</li><li>Healthy Start Nutrition formula lays the foundation for a healthy, active life with key nutrients found in mother's milk in a highly digestible puppy kibble</li><li>High protein dog food for puppies features a combination of tender and crunchy kibble for a tempting texture and a great taste puppies love</li><li>Purina Puppy Chow dog food contains 100 percent of the essential nutrients puppies need and is always crafted in the USA</li><li>Spoil your pet with Purina products. Reward yourself with points on every purchase. Download the myPurina app today</li></ul>",
